---
// Download component with platform-specific download buttons
---

<section id="download" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="inline-block bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-sm font-medium px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 border border-blue-200">
        Descarrega ara
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Disponible a totes les plataformes</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        Tria la teva plataforma i comença a gestionar els teus esdeveniments avui mateix. Ràpid, segur i fàcil d'utilitzar.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Windows -->
        <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-blue-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-12.9-1.801"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900">Windows</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">Windows 10/11 (64-bit)</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest/download/GestorEvents-Windows-x64.exe" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
            </svg>
            Descarregar per a Windows
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">.exe - 85 MB</p>
        </div>

        <!-- macOS -->
        <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-cyan-100 transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-cyan-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6h2m7-6h8m2 0h-2M7 3h10a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900">macOS</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">macOS 10.15 o posterior</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest/download/GestorEvents-macOS.dmg" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
            </svg>
            Descarregar per a Mac
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">.dmg - 92 MB</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Linux -->
        <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-purple-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-100 transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-purple-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M0 0v24h24V0H0zm19.2 9.6h-6.4V6.4h6.4v3.2zM6.4 6.4v3.2H0V6.4h6.4zM0 16h6.4v-3.2H0V16zm12.8 0h6.4v-3.2h-6.4V16z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900">Linux</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">.deb, .rpm i AppImage</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
            </svg>
            Veure descàrregues
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">.deb, .rpm, AppImage</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Android APK -->
        <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 p-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-green-200 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-green-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900">Android</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">Android 6.0+</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases" 
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-emerald-500 hover:from-green-700 hover:to-emerald-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
            </svg>
            Descarregar APK
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3 font-medium">Instal·lació manual (Sideloading)</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">No disponible a Play Store</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center">
          <div class="md:w-2/3 md:pr-8 mb-6 md:mb-0">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">Necessites una altra versió?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Visita la nostra pàgina de versions per a descarregar versions anteriors o altres variants de la plataforma.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:w-1/3">
            <a 
              href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors"
            >
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2 text-gray-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
              Veure totes les versions
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- System Requirements -->
      <div class="mt-16 text-left max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">Requisits del sistema</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-3 text-gray-900 flex items-center">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              Mínims
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                Processador de doble nucli de 2 GHz o superior
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                4 GB de RAM
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                200 MB d'espai lliure en disc
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                Connexió a Internet ocasional per a actualitzacions
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-3 text-gray-900 flex items-center">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
              Recomanats
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                Processador de 4 nuclis de 2,5 GHz o superior
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                8 GB de RAM o més
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                SSD amb 500 MB d'espai lliure
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                Connexió a Internet estable per a sincronització
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- GitHub Link -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal" 
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.167 6.839 9.49.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.34-3.369-1.34-.454-1.156-1.11-1.463-1.11-1.463-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.578 9.578 0 0112 6.836c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.336 1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.202 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.578.688.48C19.138 20.163 22 16.416 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z"/>
          </svg>
          Codi font a GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
